{"story":{"id":"story-517a35823bbfc63b","title":{"zh":"一种隐喻的语言","en":"A Language of Metaphor"},"category":"society","image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","start":"first_contact.355","chapters":4,"nodes":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"随着我们进一步调查[This.ContactCountry.GetName]——我们现在知道是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]——我们终于知道他们使用的短语常常用典于在过去一些时间点上发生的重大的、知名的事件。这些典故的意味在他们族人内部显然是广为人知的，可以用于表达一种情感，或描述事务的状态。\n\n幸运的是，看上去这种形式的语言并不是唯一的版本，仅仅作为“高端腔”，用于官方的场合或者智者之间的交流。一种更加广泛的“低端腔”文法在非正式的场合被频繁使用，特别是在年轻人或者文化水平不高","en":"As we continued to investigate the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] - who we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] - it became clear that the phrases they use are references to significant, well-known events that happened at some point in their pas"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.355","first_contact.356","first_contact.357","first_contact.358"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.355","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"first_contact.356","parent":"first_contact.355","depth":1,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们肯定可以讲他们真正的语言。","en":"Surely we can manage to speak their true language."}},{"id":"first_contact.357","parent":"first_contact.356","depth":2,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName]，[riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis]的[riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural]在召唤。","en":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName], [riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis] [riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural] beckoning."}},{"id":"first_contact.358","parent":"first_contact.356","depth":2,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName]，[riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis]的[riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural]在召唤。","en":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName], [riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis] [riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural] beckoning."}}],"links":[{"from":"first_contact.355","to":"first_contact.356","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们肯定可以讲他们真正的语言。","en":"Surely we can manage to speak their true language."}},{"from":"first_contact.356","to":"first_contact.357","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName]，[riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis]的[riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural]在召唤。","en":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName], [riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis] [riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural] beckoning."}},{"from":"first_contact.356","to":"first_contact.358","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName]，[riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis]的[riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural]在召唤。","en":"[riddles_leader_1.GetFirstName], [riddles_leader_1.GetHerHis] [riddles_leader_1.Species.GetHandNamePlural] beckoning."}},{"from":"first_contact.356","to":"first_contact.357","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"[riddles_leader_2.GetFirstName]，[riddles_leader_2.GetHerHis]的[riddles_leader_2.Species.GetEarNamePlural]在聆听。","en":"[riddles_leader_2.GetFirstName], [riddles_leader_2.GetHerHis] [riddles_leader_2.Species.GetEarNamePlural] listening."}},{"from":"first_contact.356","to":"first_contact.358","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"[riddles_leader_2.GetFirstName]，[riddles_leader_2.GetHerHis]的[riddles_leader_2.Species.GetEarNamePlural]在聆听。","en":"[riddles_leader_2.GetFirstName], [riddles_leader_2.GetHerHis] [riddles_leader_2.Species.GetEarNamePlural] listening."}}]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.355","title":{"zh":"一种隐喻的语言","en":"A Language of Metaphor"},"texts":[{"zh":"随着我们进一步调查[This.ContactCountry.GetName]——我们现在知道是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]——我们终于知道他们使用的短语常常用典于在过去一些时间点上发生的重大的、知名的事件。这些典故的意味在他们族人内部显然是广为人知的，可以用于表达一种情感，或描述事务的状态。\n\n幸运的是，看上去这种形式的语言并不是唯一的版本，仅仅作为“高端腔”，用于官方的场合或者智者之间的交流。一种更加广泛的“低端腔”文法在非正式的场合被频繁使用，特别是在年轻人或者文化水平不高的人之间。不幸的是，同一个地位颇高的人使用“低端腔”交流是一件非常具有侮辱意味的事情，我们要是这样同他们沟通，他们准把我们当作智力等同于小孩的物种来对待……","en":"As we continued to investigate the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] - who we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] - it became clear that the phrases they use are references to significant, well-known events that happened at some point in their past. The meanings of these references are apparently generally recognized among their kind, and can be a shorthand for expressing a sentiment or state of affairs.\n\nFortunately, it seems that this form of their language is not the only version of it, but merely the \"high speech\", used in official settings and between intellectuals. An altogether more comprehensible \"low speech\" vernacular is used in more informal settings, especially among the young and those of lesser intelligence. Unfortunately, it is considered gravely insulting to speak to one of high standing using the \"low speech\", so that they must treat us as the intellectual equivalents of children in order to communicate with us..."},{"zh":"随着我们对其调查的深入，[This.ContactCountry.GetName]——现在我们知道叫[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]——他们使用的语句其实是某种我们未获取秘钥的编码。显然它们指的是在我们[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]之间共享的知识的事件，可能是表达情感或事态的简写。\n\n幸运的是，他们并不是总用这种“高级语言”来交流，除非是在沟通重要的事项。一种并行的更易理解的“低级语言”则被运用于非正式的场合，特别是年轻个体和低智力个体间。然而，看起来那些高等个体们对“低级语言”使用者嗤之以鼻，也就是说他们可能把我们当做智力等同于孩童一般与我们进行交流……","en":"As we continued to investigate the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] - who we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] - it became clear that the phrases they use are some sort of code to which we lack the key. Apparently they refer to events that are shared knowledge among the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural], and can be a shorthand for expressing a sentiment or state of affairs.\n\nFortunately, it seems that they do not always communicate in such a manner but merely use this \"high speech\" when important matters are being discussed. An altogether more comprehensible \"low speech\" vernacular is used in more informal settings, especially among the young and those of lesser intelligence. Unfortunately, it seems that those of high standing react with scorn to those using the \"low speech\", meaning that they must treat us as the intellectual equivalents of children in order to communicate with us..."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"懂了，这就用“低端腔”同他们对线。","en":"Contact them in the \"low speech\"."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84a703"},{"target":"first_contact.1105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-f4810be797c73d62"},{"target":"first_contact.1110","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-4c442c803066d8b5"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_fruitful"},{"target":"cara.1020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-d7b8fcad4ef27504"},{"target":"cara.2020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-c9b49b23ac539406"},{"target":"cara.3020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-2bb89e85cc3f8c94"},{"target":"marauder.15","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_heirs_of_the_khan"},{"target":"leviathans.102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-80b79499ff487797"},{"target":"leviathans.301","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.295","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.502","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-7955ff16d7a36494"},{"target":"enclave.205","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_shroudwalker_apprentice"},{"target":"enclave.305","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-5f883b0f23e4af78"},{"target":"enclave.405","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-5f883b0f23e4af78"},{"target":"shroud.6853","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.6852","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.6851","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.4350","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.4320","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.4340","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.4300","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.4205","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"nomads.105","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-a3a24e654a3883d1"},{"target":"nomads.160","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-a3a24e654a3883d1"},{"target":"namarian.10","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们肯定可以讲他们真正的语言。","en":"Surely we can manage to speak their true language."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.356","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-517a35823bbfc63b"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[0,1]}]},{"id":"first_contact.356","title":{"zh":"联络[This.ContactCountry.GetName]","en":"Contacting the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]"},"texts":[{"zh":"[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap][This.Leader.GetName]顿了顿，看上去很迷惑。我们从他们信息的开头采集了几个短语。我们应该怎么和他们打招呼？","en":"[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap] [This.Leader.GetName] pauses, looking confused. We have gathered several phrases that they seem to begin their messages with. Which should we use to greet them?"}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"[riddles_leader_1.G