st of Greetings"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的发言得到了立即的反应。微笑——至少我们相信是和微笑类似的表情——在[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]间洋溢开来，他们嘴里讲了几个短语，用的是不容置喙的友好的字词。看上去我们选择致敬的方式选对了。","en":"The reaction to our words was instantaneous. Smiles - or at least, what we believe to be their equivalent of smiles - broke out among the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural], who uttered several phrases of unmistakably friendly character. It seems we chose our form of greeting well."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"这是一群令人愉悦的人。","en":"A most delightful people."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84a703"},{"target":"first_contact.1105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-f4810be797c73d62"},{"target":"first_contact.1110","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-4c442c803066d8b5"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_fruitful"},{"target":"cara.1020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-d7b8fcad4ef27504"},{"target":"cara.2020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-c9b49b23ac539406"},{"target":"cara.3020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-2bb89e85cc3f8c94"},{"target":"marauder.15","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_heirs_of_the_khan"},{"target":"leviathans.102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-80b79499ff487797"},{"target":"leviathans.301","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.295","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.502","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-7955ff16d7a36494"},{"target":"enclave.205","c