ional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"nomads.105","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-a3a24e654a3883d1"},{"target":"nomads.160","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-a3a24e654a3883d1"},{"target":"namarian.10","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"first_contact.358","title":{"zh":"一个糟糕的选择","en":"A Poor Choice"},"texts":[{"zh":"话语刚一说出口，很明显我们就选错了。[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]保持了很长一段的沉默，接着我们遭到了如连珠炮一般措辞强烈的谴责。他们的意图很明显带有敌意，即便他们想要表达的准确意味尚不明确——我们本来打算着让[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]印象深刻，结果是我们羞辱了他们。\n\n往好处看，至少我们现在能和他们沟通了，某种程度上。","en":"As soon as the words were uttered, it was obvious that we had chosen poorly. The [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural] held their silence for a long moment before we were beset by a barrage of harshly-spoken phrases. Their intent is clearly hostile, even if their exact meaning remains unclear - it seems that in our attempt to impress the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural], we only manage to insult them.\n\nOn the positive side, at least we are able to communicate with them now, to some degree."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/49238b3a2ea53b060771.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"他们会慢慢习惯的。","en":"They will get over it."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84a703"},{"target":"first_contact.1105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-f4810be797c73d62"},{"target":"first_contact.1110","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-4c442c803066d8b5"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_fruitful"},{"target":"cara.1020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-d7b8fcad4ef27504"},{"tar